# Blood Sun (all lands lose all abilities except mana abilities, layer 6) arrives after Consecrate Land, so the Plains loses
# the indestructible the Aura granted (CR 613.1f, 613.7). The Aura's refusal of other Auras is a rule of the Aura's, not an
# ability of the land (CR 303.4, 113.1a), so it holds: Bot2's Blight resolves into its owner's graveyard (CR 303.4i). Then
# Stone Rain destroys the Plains.

